# A small party on the trail: the pets walk in a line, a treat makes them zoom (then it needs
# time), and while they wait at an event the map keeps them where they stopped.
from pile_full
view full
pets 4
find cart
wait popup
expect text "new: small parties!"
click "lovely"
send meadow 3
wait 1
expect text "toss a treat"
shot trail
click "toss a treat"
expect text "zoom!"
shot zoom
wait text "next treat in*"
wait event
shot event_trail
click "‹ map"
wait 1
expect fits
shot event_map
